    "以亚洲大型鼯鼠为参考，主要生活在森林树冠层。" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Based on Asia’s giant flying squirrels, which live mainly in the forest canopy."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "以亞洲大型鼯鼠為參考，主要生活於森林樹冠層。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "以低地貘为参考，原产南美洲森林和湿地。" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Based on the lowland tapir, native to South American forests and wetlands."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "以低地貘為參考，原產南美洲森林與濕地。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "以叙利亚仓鼠为参考，野外原产叙利亚、土耳其一带。" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Based on the Syrian hamster, native in the wild to parts of Syria and Türkiye."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "以敘利亞倉鼠為參考，野外原產敘利亞與土耳其一帶。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "以小企鹅为参考，原产澳大利亚和新西兰沿海。" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Based on the little penguin, native to the coasts of Australia and New Zealand."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "以小企鵝為參考，原產澳洲與紐西蘭沿海。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "以环尾狐猴为参考，野外仅见于马达加斯加南部和西南部。" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Based on the ring-tailed lemur, found only in southern and southwestern Madagascar."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "以環尾狐猴為參考，野外僅見於馬達加斯加南部與西南部。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "优雅安静、节奏很慢，是先远远看着再慢慢走近的白色小伙伴。" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Quiet and graceful, watching from afar before taking a measured step closer."
          }
