      }
    },
    "会打开 Apple 的系统分享面板。对方接受后，就能和你一起查看、添加和编辑这个宝宝的记录。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This opens Apple’s system sharing sheet. Once accepted, the other parent can view, add, and edit this baby’s records with you."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "系統會開啟 Apple 分享面板。對方接受後，就能和你一起查看、新增及編輯這位寶寶的記錄。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "会随环境慢慢调整状态，是适应力强又有自己节奏的雪地小精灵。" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Adjusts gently to the surroundings—adaptable, yet always true to their own rhythm."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "會隨環境慢慢調整狀態，適應力強，也有自己的節奏。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
