    "大眼睛、动作快，是容易受惊但滑翔起来特别优雅的夜空小星星。" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bright-eyed and quick, easily startled on the ground but beautifully graceful in motion."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "大眼睛、動作快，容易受驚，滑翔時卻格外優雅。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "大耳朵、慢半拍，是需要宽宽空间和慢慢节奏的温和大朋友。" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
