    "天然笑脸、慢热谨慎，是笑着观察很久才愿意靠近的小太阳。" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Naturally sunny but careful, smiling from a distance until they are ready to come close."
