    "感受强烈、反应很快，需要更多安抚和提前预告。" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Feels everything intensely and reacts quickly, thriving with reassurance and a little advance notice."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "感受強烈、反應很快，需要更多安撫與事先提醒。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "感受细腻、动作很快，是紧张时想躲一躲、安心后会主动贴近的小伙伴。" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Sensitive and quick, hiding when unsure and drawing close on their own once reassured."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "感受細膩、動作很快，緊張時想躲一躲，安心後會主動靠近。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
