    "温顺松弛、节奏稳定，是会把紧张气氛慢慢变软的小伙伴。" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Gentle and grounded, with a steady presence that helps tension melt away."
