            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Originated among the Samoyedic peoples of Siberia and is now kept worldwide as a companion dog."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "源自西伯利亞薩摩耶人地區，現作為家犬在全球多地飼養。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
